      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Oh, I got a GET /parking-lot what shall I do?\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Oh, I got a GET /parking-lot what shall I do?\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rR1235z1ObjfIEP_Ahnr6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 481,
      "y": 639,
      "width": 757.599609375,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1457517848,
      "version": 322,
      "versionNonce": 1703664232,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790105760789,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GET /parking-lot\n    - Create an instance of the Items Controller\n    - Oh, that needs an IDocumentSession - create a new one of those for it\n    - Call the GetItemsAsync method (give it a token)\n    - WAIT for it to do that stuff\n    - return the result\n    - Repeat as necessary",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GET /parking-lot\n    - Create an instance of the Items Controller\n    - Oh, that needs an IDocumentSession - create a new one of those for it\n    - Call the GetItemsAsync method (give it a token)\n    - WAIT for it to do that stuff\n    - return the result\n    - Repeat as necessary",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
